  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(A) Pressure gradient is stated as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(III)</p><p>(B) Energy density is stated as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Energy</mi><mi>Volume</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(II)</p><p>(C) Electric field is stated as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Force</mi><mi>Charge</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>AT</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(IV)</p><p>(D) Latent heat is stated as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Heat</mi><mi>Mass</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Energy</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mi>Mass</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(I)</p>",
